#tools
# Original SGI IRIX 5.3 IDO toolchain (proprietary SGI binaries) and the SGI
# image viewer are NOT distributed with this repo. They are only needed to
# build the N64 ROM or to regenerate tools/ido5.3_recomp; the PC port does not
# use them. See docs/SetupGuide.md "Recompile IDO" for how to obtain them.
